SUMMARY:Conor Janda LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260716T055640Z
DTSTART:20260716T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nConor Jan
	da is a sharp\, witty stand-up comedian who has been making waves on the n
	ational comedy circuit with his clever writing and relatable storytelling.
	 Known for his dry humor and self-deprecating style\, Janda has a gift for
	 finding the absurdity in everyday life and turning it into laugh-out-loud
	 material. \nA regular on the club circuit and a rising presence in the co
	medy world\, Conor Janda has earned a reputation as one of the most consis
	tently funny performers working today. His sets are tight\, well-crafted\,
	 and delivered with a natural ease that makes even the most complex observ
	ations feel effortless. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or catching him fo
	r the first time\, Conor Janda’s show at Cobb’s Comedy Club promises to be
	 a memorable night of stand-up comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, J
	uly 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus
	 Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Mini
	mum\nTicket Price Range: $28 – $47 \nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club i
	s one of San Francisco’s most iconic comedy destinations\, nestled in the 
	vibrant North Beach neighborhood at 915 Columbus Avenue. With a capacity o
	f approximately 400 guests\, the club delivers an intimate\, up-close expe
	rience that makes every seat feel like the best in the house. \nThe venue 
	features a full bar and table service\, so you can enjoy cocktails\, beer\
	, wine\, and food throughout the performance. The classic comedy club layo
	ut — tables and chairs arranged around a central stage — ensures excellent
	 sightlines and a communal atmosphere that amplifies the laughs. \nCobb’s 
	is easily accessible by public transit and is surrounded by some of San Fr
	ancisco’s best restaurants and bars\, making it a perfect spot for a full 
	night out. Parking is available in nearby garages throughout the North Bea
	ch area. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Conor Ja
	nda — a full evening of his signature observational and self-deprecating c
	omedy. Expect a polished\, well-paced show with sharp writing and plenty o
	f big laughs from start to finish. \nThe 18+ age restriction and 2-beverag
	e minimum are in effect. Doors typically open 30–45 minutes before showtim
	e\, so arrive early to get settled and enjoy a pre-show drink before the l
	aughs kick off. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $28 – $47 (before taxes
	 and fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and Vivi
	dSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains aff
	iliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:/
	/comedycalendar.com/event/conor-janda-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom C
	omedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/conor-janda-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, Califor
	nia\, 94133\, United States Of America
