	d\, Oxnard\, CA 93036\nAge Requirement: 21+ Event\nMinimum Purchase: Two-i
	tem minimum per person in the showroom \nAbout Nurse John\nNurse John is a
	 rising stand-up comedian who has built a massive following with his uniqu
	e blend of observational humor and storytelling. His “Short Staffed” tour 
	has been selling out venues across the country\, bringing his signature co
	medic style to audiences everywhere. With a background that gives him plen
