SUMMARY:The Setup: Speakeasy Comedy New York LIVE at ReVision Lounge and Ga
	llery
DTSTAMP:20260716T055640Z
DTSTART:20260718T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nThe Setup: Speakeas
	y Comedy New York transforms ReVision Lounge and Gallery into a close-quar
	ters comedy secret in the heart of the Lower East Side. Comics seen on Net
	flix\, HBO\, and Comedy Central deliver close-range punchlines in an intim
	ate\, low-lit setting unlike any other in NYC. \nWith shifting lineups and
	 a singular East Village atmosphere — bathtub couches\, bike-chain lights\
	, and brick walls — every show is a one-of-a-kind experience built for las
	ting memories. \nEvent Details\nDate: July 18\, 2026 (additional dates ava
	ilable — select during purchase)\nTime: Doors open at 6:30 PM\; Show start
	s at 7:00 PM\nVenue: ReVision Lounge and Gallery\nAddress: 219 Avenue B\, 
	New York\, NY 10009\nCity: New York\, NY\nPrice: $15.00\nAge Restriction: 
	21 and over with valid ID\nDuration: 2 hours \nAbout the Venue\nReVision L
	ounge and Gallery is a unique Lower East Side bar and gallery space in the
	 East Village. The venue features eclectic décor including bathtub couches
	\, instrument lights\, and recycled-money bar details\, creating a hidden\
	, speakeasy-like atmosphere perfect for intimate live comedy. \nWhat to Ex
	pect\nArrive early to grab drinks and claim prime general-admission seats 
	before the show begins. The Setup NYC features a rotating lineup of comics
	 with credits from Netflix\, HBO\, and Comedy Central performing in an unu
	sually close setting where every punchline lands with maximum impact. \nTh
	e intimate format and unique venue design make this one of New York City’s
	 most memorable comedy experiences. Note: the venue is not wheelchair acce
	ssible. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available through Fever. General
	 Admission is $15.00. A 2-for-1 ticket option may also be available. All s
	ales are final. \nGet Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/the-setu
	p-speakeasy-comedy-new-york-live-at-revision-lounge-and-gallery/\n\nFrom C
	omedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/the-setup-speakeasy-comedy-new-york-li
	ve-at-revision-lounge-and-gallery/
LOCATION:ReVision Lounge and Gallery\, 219 Avenue B\, New York\, NY\, 10009
	\, United States
